1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:07,546
Meet TG Admin. Control your Android phone from
Telegram.

2
00:00:08,096 --> 00:00:15,488
Start remote screen mirroring. View the screen, tap
Home, and stop whenever you want.

3
00:00:16,038 --> 00:00:22,998
Run real device commands. Battery, network, files,
calls, messages, camera, and location.

4
00:00:23,548 --> 00:00:30,748
No PC, no cable, no port forwarding. Just your own
private Telegram bot.

5
00:00:31,298 --> 00:00:37,994
Start on Wi-Fi. If the network drops, TG Admin can
switch to remote mode automatically.

6
00:00:38,544 --> 00:00:45,288
Release-signed, hardened with R8, owner-only chat, and
your bot token stays on your device.

7
00:00:45,838 --> 00:00:52,966
Download the signed APK from GitHub. Verify the hash,
then install over the previous version.

8
00:00:53,516 --> 00:01:00,284
TG Admin. For your own devices. Use responsibly.
